+basis of F_{p^8}, choose nonzero b1 with b1^(p^3)=-b1 and put b0=b2=0.  Writing
+lambda=b1^(p^2), Lemma 3.3's inner polynomial is
+lambda*(X^(p^2)-X).  Its kernel is exactly F_{p^2}, so the corresponding form
