+For structural reference, F below is the coordinate matrix of the
+p-power Frobenius map z -> z^p in the same 8-coordinate field basis
+used by the b1 block and by K.  Matrix-vector convention is F*v.
+F: 0 0 2 0 0 0 0 0
+F: 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 1
+F: 0 2 0 0 0 0 0 0
+F: 2 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
