The full gate suite is still running; the expensive part is the required 200,000 structure-aware samples, each already constrained to be an independent \(88\times2\) matrix. That is intentional: the guess-rate measurement is against the actual declared certificate language, not arbitrary malformed noise. No failure has surfaced yet.
