+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:2512.19324.
+
+The paper constructs maximum linear symmetric rank-distance codes through
+linearized polynomials.  This module uses one of its degree-eight codewords in
+normal-basis coordinates, composes it with invertible codeword blocks, and
+carries an exact two-column kernel certificate through a rank-one change of
+coordinates.  Generation never solves the matrix it emits.
+"""
